  "releaseNotes": "'# [9.11.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v9.10.0...v9.11.0) (2025-07-22)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **debugging:** embed untracked sources ([587862a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/587862ac2f32fef102782c6d34b2e49e9d33dfee))\n* **deps:** update dependencies ([#921](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/921)) ([ff35411](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/ff354117de98c105d163f40bad6b47a6ca79255a))\n* **deps:** update dependency @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local to ^0.52.0 ([#922](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/922)) ([b0e9e48](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b0e9e482e73d0bda94f6ee904d25be706b7929b3))\n* **patch:** Add kind, apiVersion, status to ignored fields and make JsonPatch preview feature ([e12a6a8](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e12a6a8ee4a0b3285fb8a8be2787b996b40f4823))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **caching:** introduce FusionCache for flexible L1/L2 caching ([#914](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/914)) ([2681965](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/2681965223607d65459139b3e9babafb2de913ab))\n* **client:** Add Patch functionality and patch creation ([#919](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/919)) ([f61526f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/f61526fe0a15fbe00420aba492e424a39fe5f78e)), closes [#559](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/559)\n* **debugging:** add debug symbols, determinstic builds, and source-link ([d67d8f2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d67d8f266206172631badcbb50e4dfa501b39503))\n* **patch:** Patch of entity filters volatile metadata fields like UID which are not relevant for Diffs ([#925](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/925)) ([12a80ff](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/12a80ffcee2be9fb6a16d227abf5cf71668fc909))\n\n\n\n'",
